# Local-only screenshot tooling artifacts — never committed.
node_modules/
demo-data/
shots/

# `package.json` and `package-lock.json` were listed here until the
# playwright-gate build (2026-09-05). They are MANIFESTS, not artifacts, and
# grouping them with the three above meant Playwright was declared nowhere in
# this repository: a fresh clone got the .mjs files and no way to run them, so
# every Playwright harness -- and this directory's own screenshot pipeline --
# failed at `createRequire` on any machine but the one they were written on.
# They are tracked now. Do not re-add them.
